						tag: {
							author: "Director_KW"
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"*Heavy steps heard running across solid metal flooring, gasps of panting breaths echoing through the hallways of an unknown location*\\n\\n\\\"Why... why did this have to happen... why now?'\\n\\n'I'm so close... SO CLOSE!'\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"'If I had just another week... I could've done it...\\\"\\n\\n*Mysterious person's breathing finally catches up, slowing down the fast pacing heartrate pounding inside them. Resting their back against a steel wall, the feeling of their location begins to shake\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"very violently, indicating some sort of accident occuring around them. Looking towards a large door before, they make their way to it*\\n\\n\\\"I have but one chance... once chance to make it right...\\\"\\n\\n*Approaching the double doors, they\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"place their hand on some sort of panel, lights and lasers forming around the hand before making some sort of bell sound. Doors open wide, revealing whatever lies before their very eyes*\\n\\n\\\"I have to do this... I have to activate the secret project\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"before the parasites consume everything...'\\n\\n'... *Sighs* I hope this makes up for everything I did, Daren...\\\"\"}"
